1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,880
I'll come back.

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:07,590
But only to act
with the real you, senpai.

3
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,390
Minato, don't go!

4
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:24,730
Please let me go.

5
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:27,490
I can't live without you, Minato.

6
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:30,450
Senpai...

7
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:32,990
I...

8
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:35,620
I'm neither honest nor strong.

9
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:38,410
If I have any of those qualities...

10
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:40,670
it's because of you.

11
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:55,850
You're all I have...

12
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:02,610
Minato...

13
00:01:02,610 --> 00:01:04,860
I love you.

14
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:11,570
I...

15
00:01:11,570 --> 00:01:14,070
love you, too...
